vulnerabilities.fix_suggestion:
为函数添加权限修饰符并限制调用目标，例如：

function unsafeCall(address target) external onlyOwner {
    require(whitelisted[target], 'target not allowed');
    (bool success, ) = target.call('');
    require(success, 'call failed');
}

检查并处理返回值：

(bool success, ) = target.call('');
require(success, 'External call failed');
